self.KB_CONTENT["card:758611"]={"id":"card:758611","ty":"card","sourceId":"758611","title":"『廠商ABC分析表』中的『輸入年月』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"分析表","keywords":["分析表","廠商","年月","月份"],"y":"other","answer":"* 空白表全部資料，一般週期為月、季或年。* 所輸入之月份僅能輸入在 1~12 之間。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:758637"]={"id":"card:758637","ty":"card","sourceId":"758637","title":"『供應廠商資料建立作業』中的『帳單地址(一) (MA051)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"廠商","keywords":["廠商","供應","地址"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可點選(icon)或[F2]地址資料查詢，同聯絡地址(一)圖示。* [F3]廠商地址代號維護。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
